#: ../../source/moduli/stats_utils/standard-deviation.md:13
msgid ""
"`standard_deviation` restituisce la deviazione standard come radice quadrata"
" della varianza calcolata da [`variance`](variance.md)."
msgstr ""
"`standard_deviation` returns the standard deviation as the square root of "
"the variance computed by [`variance`](variance.md)."

#: ../../source/moduli/stats_utils/standard-deviation.md:15
msgid ""
"[Panoramica](standard-deviation/panoramica.md) riassume scopo, parametri, "
"errori ed esempio d'uso; [Funzionamento](standard-"
"deviation/funzionamento.md) descrive passo per passo il flusso interno e le "
"formule implementate."
msgstr ""
"[Overview](standard-deviation/panoramica.md) summarizes purpose, parameters,"
" errors and a usage example; [Implementation](standard-"
"deviation/funzionamento.md) walks through the internal flow and the "
"implemented formulas step by step."
